[
  {
    "content_id": "10032001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的话临到亚米太的儿子约拿，说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「你起来往尼尼微大城去，向其中的居民呼喊，因为他们的恶达到我面前。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;约拿却起来，逃往他施去躲避耶和华；下到约帕，遇见一只船，要往他施去。他就给了船价，上了船，要与船上的人同往他施去躲避耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;然而耶和华使海中起大风，海就狂风大作，甚至船几乎破坏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;水手便惧怕，各人哀求自己的神。他们将船上的货物抛在海中，为要使船轻些。约拿已下到底舱，躺卧沉睡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;船主到他那里对他说：「你这沉睡的人哪，为何这样呢？起来，求告你的神，或者神顾念我们，使我们不致灭亡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;船上的人彼此说：「来吧，我们掣签，看看这灾临到我们是因谁的缘故。」于是他们掣签，掣出约拿来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;众人对他说：「请你告诉我们，这灾临到我们是因谁的缘故？你以何事为业？你从哪里来？你是哪一国？属哪一族的人？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他说：「我是希伯来人。我敬畏耶和华—那创造沧海旱地之天上的　神。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他们就大大惧怕，对他说：「你做的是什么事呢？」他们已经知道他躲避耶和华，因为他告诉了他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他们问他说：「我们当向你怎样行，使海浪平静呢？」这话是因海浪越发翻腾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他对他们说：「你们将我抬起来，抛在海中，海就平静了；我知道你们遭这大风是因我的缘故。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;然而那些人竭力荡桨，要把船拢岸，却是不能，因为海浪越发向他们翻腾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他们便求告耶和华说：「耶和华啊，我们恳求你，不要因这人的性命使我们死亡，不要使流无辜血的罪归与我们；因为你—耶和华是随自己的意旨行事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他们遂将约拿抬起，抛在海中，海的狂浪就平息了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;那些人便大大敬畏耶和华，向耶和华献祭，并且许愿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和华安排一条大鱼吞了约拿，他在鱼腹中三日三夜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;约拿在鱼腹中祷告耶和华—他的　神，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;说： 我遭遇患难求告耶和华， 你就应允我； 从阴间的深处呼求， 你就俯听我的声音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你将我投下深渊， 就是海的深处； 大水环绕我， 你的波浪洪涛都漫过我身。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我说：我从你眼前虽被驱逐， 我仍要仰望你的圣殿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;诸水环绕我，几乎淹没我； 深渊围住我； 海草缠绕我的头。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我下到山根， 地的门将我永远关住。 耶和华—我的　神啊， 你却将我的性命从坑中救出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我心在我里面发昏的时候， 我就想念耶和华。 我的祷告进入你的圣殿， 达到你的面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那信奉虚无之神的人， 离弃怜爱他们的主；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但我必用感谢的声音献祭与你。 我所许的愿，我必偿还。 救恩出于耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和华吩咐鱼，鱼就把约拿吐在旱地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的话二次临到约拿说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「你起来！往尼尼微大城去，向其中的居民宣告我所吩咐你的话。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;约拿便照耶和华的话起来，往尼尼微去。这尼尼微是极大的城，有三日的路程。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;约拿进城走了一日，宣告说：「再等四十日，尼尼微必倾覆了！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;尼尼微人信服　神，便宣告禁食，从最大的到至小的都穿麻衣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;这信息传到尼尼微王的耳中，他就下了宝座，脱下朝服，披上麻布，坐在灰中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他又使人遍告尼尼微通城，说：「王和大臣有令，人不可尝什么，牲畜、牛羊不可吃草，也不可喝水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;人与牲畜都当披上麻布；人要切切求告　神。各人回头离开所行的恶道，丢弃手中的强暴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;或者　神转意后悔，不发烈怒，使我们不致灭亡，也未可知。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;于是　神察看他们的行为，见他们离开恶道，他就后悔，不把所说的灾祸降与他们了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这事约拿大大不悦，且甚发怒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;就祷告耶和华说：「耶和华啊，我在本国的时候岂不是这样说吗？我知道你是有恩典、有怜悯的　神，不轻易发怒，有丰盛的慈爱，并且后悔不降所说的灾，所以我急速逃往他施去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和华啊，现在求你取我的命吧！因为我死了比活着还好。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：「你这样发怒合乎理吗？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;于是约拿出城，坐在城的东边，在那里为自己搭了一座棚，坐在棚的荫下，要看看那城究竟如何。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和华　神安排一棵蓖麻，使其发生高过约拿，影儿遮盖他的头，救他脱离苦楚；约拿因这棵蓖麻大大喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;次日黎明，　神却安排一条虫子咬这蓖麻，以致枯槁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;日头出来的时候，　神安排炎热的东风，日头曝晒约拿的头，使他发昏，他就为自己求死，说：「我死了比活着还好！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;神对约拿说：「你因这棵蓖麻发怒合乎理吗？」他说：「我发怒以至于死，都合乎理！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说：「这蓖麻不是你栽种的，也不是你培养的；一夜发生，一夜干死，你尚且爱惜；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10032004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约拿书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "32004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;何况这尼尼微大城，其中不能分辨左手右手的有十二万多人，并有许多牲畜，我岂能不爱惜呢？」</p>"
  }
]